{
  "name": "XPBase",
  "version": "1.2.0",
  "summary": "iOS 开发基础工具库，提供屏幕适配、网络请求、UI组件、日志等常用功能。",
  "description": "XPBase 是一个功能丰富的 iOS 开发基础工具库，包含以下核心模块：\n\nUIKit 模块\n- XPScreen: 屏幕信息工具类，提供全面的屏幕尺寸、设备类型、安全区域等信息\n- XPDevice: 设备信息工具类\n- XPColor/XPFont: 颜色和字体工具类\n- 各种自定义 UI 组件（XPUnderlineButton、XPCountDownButton 等）\n\nTool 模块\n- XPTimer: 线程安全的定时器管理\n- XPDebounce/XPThrottle: 防抖和节流工具\n- XPAsync: 异步任务调度\n- XPTime: 时间工具类\n- XPCacheManager/XPKeyChain: 缓存和安全存储\n\nNetwork 模块\n- 基于 Moya 的网络请求封装\n- XPNetworkLoggerPlugin: 网络日志插件\n- XPReachableManager: 网络可达性监听\n\nExtensions 模块\n- 丰富的 Swift 扩展（Array、String、Date、UIColor、UIView）\n\n详细文档请参考 docs/ 目录。",
  "homepage": "https://github.com/travelcookies/XPBase",
  "documentation_url": "https://github.com/travelcookies/XPBase/tree/main/XPBase/docs",
  "license": {
    "type": "MIT",
    "file": "LICENSE"
  },
  "authors": {
    "roc-mini": "cjdesyue@126.com"
  },
  "source": {
    "git": "https://github.com/travelcookies/XPBase.git",
    "tag": "1.2.0"
  },
  "platforms": {
    "ios": "12.0"
  },
  "resource_bundles": {
    "XPBase": [
      "XPBase/Classes/**/*.xib",
      "XPBase/Classes/**/*.png",
      "XPBase/Classes/**/*.jpg",
      "XPBase/Classes/**/*.jpeg",
      "XPBase/Classes/**/*.gif"
    ]
  },
  "frameworks": "UIKit",
  "dependencies": {
    "Alamofire": [

    ],
    "Moya": [

    ],
    "HandyJSON": [

    ],
    "SnapKit": [

    ],
    "Toast-Swift": [

    ],
    "ReachabilitySwift": [

    ],
    "GKNavigationBar/NavigationBar": [

    ],
    "URLNavigator": [

    ]
  },
  "subspecs": [
    {
      "name": "Extensions",
      "source_files": "XPBase/Classes/Extensions/**/*"
    },
    {
      "name": "Network",
      "source_files": "XPBase/Classes/Network/**/*",
      "dependencies": {
        "XPBase/Extensions": [

        ],
        "XPBase/UIKit": [

        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "UIKit",
      "source_files": "XPBase/Classes/UIKit/**/*",
      "dependencies": {
        "XPBase/Extensions": [

        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Log",
      "source_files": "XPBase/Classes/Log/**/*"
    },
    {
      "name": "Tool",
      "source_files": "XPBase/Classes/Tool/**/*",
      "dependencies": {
        "XPBase/UIKit": [

        ],
        "XPBase/Network": [

        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
